</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <h1>Air Jordan Sneaker Resale Market Analysis</h1>
  <p>Comprehensive Secondary-Market Transaction Review (2023–2026)</p>
  <div class="meta">{fmt_int(total_transactions)} transactions &middot; {date_min} to {date_max} &middot; {len(df['Shoe_Model'].unique())} models &middot; {len(df['Colorway'].unique())} colorways &middot; {len(df['Sales_Channel'].unique())} channels</div>
